MSN 4.6 Smileys for KMerlin 0.3.2

Copy all *.png files and the smileyrc file to the KMerlin smilies directory
Example:
(SUSE)
su -c "cp *.png /opt/kde2/share/apps/kmerlin/smilies"
su -c "cp smileyrc /opt/kde2/share/apps/kmerlin/smilies"

(RH and Mandrake)
su -c "cp *.png /usr/share/apps/kmerlin/smilies"
su -c "cp smileyrc /usr/share/apps/kmerlin/smilies"


Have fun!

